e for shield to  monitor the island  so i checked on other outposts and yes  shadow is being deleted from existence  everything is being renovated midas  legacy  will soon be forgotten remember all  those ritual sites we can find  everywhere on the island they have the  icons of gods of elements like water  fire  thunder that sort of thing well there is  a brand new one that has been added this  season and it's at the top of  this mountain it looks like a place for  thor to regain his powers  maybe as part of a quest line for him or  maybe storm  hmm let's watch this place hang on i  feel like there's something missing here  there it is hot watch is continuing to  grow  this week the fencing is in place on the  first layer  it's slow progress at this rate we could  have an official poi by i don't know  chapter  seven maybe fingers crossed i'd watch  forever  next i double checked on graham to make  sure he was okay  and yeah he's fine and the radio tower  he lives in hasn't had any changes at  all  but that's when i noticed in the sky we  can actually see galactus approaching  extremely slowly the live event at the  end of the season is going to blow our  minds  hopefully we'll see the avengers take  down galactus using their unique powers  and maybe we'll join in too up to this  point we've spectated in live events  could this be the season we become  integral to the story and join in one  more thing to go over  and it's a big thing of the season the  crustaceans  last season we watched as the wobbly  blobs began to go through the evolution  of man  wobbly blubs i say stupid stuff don't i  anyway they built a small colony they  pillaged the seas as pirates  they created egyptian sculptures and  then  a city to be proud of then they got a  bit ahead of themselves they made a  rocket sent it into space  and finally they caused a nuclear  mushroom cloud to eviscerate themselves  right now they live like this what  has gone on here it's like a colony of  cyborgs pat cr